# Mode$ AttackerBlockedOnce with ValidCard$ Creature.YouCtrl
# (TriggerAttackerBlockedOnce.performTest matches it against the whole list of
# blocked attackers): Big Spender and Grizzly Bears attack, both are blocked,
# and Big Spender's "whenever one or more creatures you control become
# blocked, create a Treasure token" makes exactly one Treasure.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 3=1,4=2
declareblockers
resolvestack
